      "created_at": "2021-05-22T05:18:36.556Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m not too concerned from an RPG perspective; the core book is quite complete and if nothing else if ever finished I’m good to go.</p>\n<p>My main concern is from a lore perspective; C+A have been reluctant to discuss things that are planned for upcoming books. I don’t really want to wait 3-5 years to hear about what Dark Watch is up to, never mind the Cosmic stuff that isn’t even in an upcoming book yet…</p>",
